<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK O/N REPO AVE YIELD HITS 18.36 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK O/N REPO AVE YIELD HITS 18.36 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at a Czech National Bank (CNB) overnight repo tender on Wednesday hit 18.36 percent, the CNB said in a statement.</p>
<p>The CNB added in a statement that 62 percent of bids were satisfied at the minimum limit rate of 18.25 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB does not announce the amount of funds it adds to the market through its opeations.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
